    <briefdescription>
<para>Abstract base for per-subdir config lifecycle — initialise, saveToPath, loadFromPath, startWatcher. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classconfig_1_1_directory" kindref="compound">Directory</ref> implements the self-contained four-phase contract for a single config subdirectory passed as a resolved <computeroutput><ref refid="classjuce_1_1File" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">juce::File</ref>:</computeroutput> </para>
<para><orderedlist>
<listitem><para><computeroutput><ref refid="classconfig_1_1_directory_1ae83c28995bbec814ee15b291306be400" kindref="member">initialise()</ref></computeroutput> — build in-memory defaults from <ref refid="namespaceBinaryData" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">BinaryData</ref>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>saveToPath(dir)</computeroutput> — write missing files from <ref refid="namespaceBinaryData" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">BinaryData</ref> to disk inline.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>loadFromPath(dir)—</computeroutput> clear state and read from disk into <computeroutput>state</computeroutput>, then fire <computeroutput>state.sendPropertyChangeMessage</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para><computeroutput>startWatcher(dir)—</computeroutput> install the filesystem watcher on <computeroutput>dir</computeroutput>.</para>
</listitem></orderedlist>
</para>
<para>Subclasses supply the load and save policy (<ref refid="classconfig_1_1_theme" kindref="compound">Theme</ref>, <ref refid="classconfig_1_1_shader" kindref="compound">Shader</ref>) by implementing the pure-virtual hooks. The owner (<computeroutput><ref refid="classconfig_1_1_model" kindref="compound">config::Model</ref></computeroutput>) resolves the directory via the bimap and passes a <computeroutput><ref refid="classjuce_1_1File" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/JUCE/docs/tagfile.xml">juce::File</ref></computeroutput> directly into <computeroutput><ref refid="classconfig_1_1_directory_1a1ea8c2e469d5d9c789fcc7aa117c2cb8" kindref="member">load()</ref></computeroutput>. Subclasses fire their own <computeroutput>state.sendPropertyChangeMessage</computeroutput> inside <computeroutput>loadFromPath</computeroutput> — there is no shared notify method on the base.</para>
<para><simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="classjam_1_1Model" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::Model</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="structjam_1_1File_1_1Watcher" kindref="compound" external="/Users/jreng/Documents/Poems/dev/jam/docs/tagfile.xml">jam::File::Watcher</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
